  <h1 class="gd-h1">Heli-Ski Resorts: Where You Actually Heli-Ski</h1>
  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 7 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">People often search for "heli-ski resorts", expecting somewhere with lifts, pistes and a heli option bolted on. The honest answer is that heli-skiing does not really work that way, and that is the whole point. There are no lifts and no resort, just a lodge, a helicopter and a mountain range of untracked snow. This guide explains what heli-skiing actually is, what a heli-ski lodge is, and where in the world you can do it, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
</div></section>
